{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:b14f4f21249967b1","name":"QuickFire Speeder Bike","source":{"id":"source:reference-b14f4f21249967b1","title":"QuickFire Speeder Bike","revision":20281,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:33:29Z","sha256":"3d7ae94b954e82df81d060668612d06b6f9fd6e7f5a342b4697f96f8f82df1ad","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20281","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=QuickFire%20Speeder%20Bike&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-b14f4f21249967b1","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Black Sun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Black_Sun","referenceId":"reference:5c22b34bff28e06d"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A heavy-duty Speeder Bike, the Mobquet QuickFire is a favorite of swoop gangs and other street toughs that want a Speeder Bike to match their own disposition. The QuickFire Speeder Bike boasts a large, rumbling repulsor engine and a thick frame that gives the bike a stronger pull, if not more speed. Though slower than some other top-of-the-line ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speeder Bikes"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speeder_Bikes"},", the QuickFire has larger towing capacity and can support many heavier modifications. The bike's armor plating makes the QuickFire more durable and better able to resist stray blaster fire.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Mobquet QuickFire is one of the few Speeder Bikes on the market to include built-in weaponry. Ostensibly intended for clearing debris (Mobquet markets the QuickFire for use in rough terrain), the Speeder Bike's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Blaster Cannon"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Blaster_Cannon","referenceId":"reference:ae1584087cb7657b"}," is slightly depowered to pass Imperial regulations on civilian vessels. The QuickFire is a standard Speeder Bike used by [[Black Su]n]] agents throughout the galaxy, and is especially popular among ",{"tag":"a","children":["Black Sun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Black_Sun","referenceId":"reference:5c22b34bff28e06d"}," pirate gangs that raid settlements throughout ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Outer Rim"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Outer_Rim?action=edit&redlink=1"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Default (Skilled)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["QuickFire Speeder Bike Statistics (CL 7)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Large ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speeder"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speeder"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +11; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +6\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},": 19 (",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"},": 13), ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},": 16; +4 Armor, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicular Combat"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicular_Combat","referenceId":"reference:31246426131b3457"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"},": 60; ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Reduction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Reduction"},": 5; ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Threshold"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki